axes.runtime:
An **official hosted remote server** (no self-hosted line): the US endpoint https://mcp.intercom.com/mcp,
the EU endpoint https://mcp.eu.intercom.com/mcp (EU requests are processed within the EU, in line with its Regional Data Hosting commitments);
**AU-hosted workspaces are not yet supported** (stated plainly by the official docs). The endpoints measured 401 direct (they exist, auth required — not dead links).

axes.tools:
The current official-docs count is **14 tools**: the universal family **search** (query DSL: object_type:conversations/contacts,
field operators eq/neq/gt/contains, pagination via starting_after) + **fetch** (full details by prefixed ID);
the direct-API family search_conversations / get_conversation / search_contacts / companies /
Help Center articles (**list/search/get read + create/update write**);
and the **five Fin Operator tools** (send_operator_message / get_operator_response / get_proposal_details /
apply_proposals / reject_proposals — apply changes your workspace's live configuration).
